WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.242 line:92% size:92%
A pest is attacking your crop.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.000 line:92% size:92%
But you are not alone: two beneficial fungi arrive.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.608 line:92% size:92%
Their spores stick to the insect, germinate and control it from within.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.135 line:92% size:92%
And they do not stop: sporulating on the pest, they multiply.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:24.139 line:92% size:92%
Applied preventively, it protects your crop before the pest arrives.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.800 line:92% size:92%
Together they make NANO-MIX 10GW, a microbial insecticide.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.869 line:92% size:92%
Its secret: a water-soluble gel that protects the spores for up to two years.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:40.508 line:92% size:92%
In other formulations, the spores sink to the bottom, stay suspended or compact.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:45.707 line:92% size:92%
With NANO-MIX, they stay throughout the container: every dose carries the same.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.749 line:92% size:92%
Easy to apply, zero days of residue and no resistance build-up.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.384 line:92% size:92%
NANO-MIX, by Demeter. Certified organic.
